{"sha": "323ab79ce18b1f3c37c005d83d3b35d5adf2a6c723dd3b985151b055217d3f1f", "body": ["\\section{中心极限定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[中心极限定理]\\label{thm:b3:clt:clt}", "设 $(X_n)$ 为独立同分布，$\\E X_1 = m$ 且 $\\V(X_1) =", "\\sigma^2 \\in \\intoo0\\infty$，则\\index{中心", "极限定理}", "\\[", "\\frac{S_n - nm}{\\sigma\\sqrt n} \\;\\Longrightarrow\\; \\mathcal", "N(0, 1) :", "\\qquad", "\\P\\Bigl(a \\leq \\frac{S_n - nm}{\\sigma\\sqrt n} \\leq", "b\\Bigr) \\longrightarrow", "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\\int_a^b\\eu^{-x^2/2}\\,\\dd x", "\\]", "对所有 $a < b$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "中心化并标准化：$Z_i = \\frac{X_i - m}{\\sigma}$", "（独立同分布，均值为 $0$，方差为 $1$），并记 $T_n =", "\\frac1{\\sqrt n}\\sum_{i\\leq n}Z_i$。由独立性及", "仿射性质（\\cref{prop:b3:clt:cfbasics}）：", "\\[", "\\varphi_{T_n}(\\xi) =", "\\varphi_{Z}\\Bigl(\\frac{\\xi}{\\sqrt n}\\Bigr)^{n},", "\\qquad", "\\varphi_Z(\\eta) = 1 - \\frac{\\eta^2}2 + \\eta^2\\rho(\\eta),\\quad", "\\rho(\\eta)\\to0 .", "\\]", "取定 $\\xi$，令 $a_n = \\varphi_Z(\\xi/\\sqrt n)$，$b_n = 1 -", "\\frac{\\xi^2}{2n}$，二者的模均 $\\leq 1$（只要 $n$ 充分大）；", "$\\abs{b_n} \\leq 1$ 当 $\\xi^2 \\leq 4n$ 时成立，$\\abs{a_n} \\leq 1$", "总成立。由初等不等式 $\\abs{a^n - b^n} \\leq", "n\\abs{a - b}$，对 $\\abs a, \\abs b \\leq 1$ 成立（裂项相消：", "$a^n - b^n = \\sum a^k(a - b)b^{n-1-k}$），可得", "\\[", "\\Bigl|\\varphi_{T_n}(\\xi) - \\Bigl(1 -", "\\frac{\\xi^2}{2n}\\Bigr)^{n}\\Bigr|", "\\leq n\\,\\Bigl|\\varphi_Z\\Bigl(\\frac\\xi{\\sqrt n}\\Bigr) - 1 +", "\\frac{\\xi^2}{2n}\\Bigr|", "= \\xi^2\\,\\Bigl|\\rho\\Bigl(\\frac{\\xi}{\\sqrt n}\\Bigr)\\Bigr|", "\\longrightarrow 0,", "\\]", "而 $\\bigl(1 - \\frac{\\xi^2}{2n}\\bigr)^n \\to", "\\eu^{-\\xi^2/2}$（取实对数）。于是 $\\varphi_{T_n}(\\xi) \\to", "\\eu^{-\\xi^2/2} = \\varphi_{\\mathcal N(0,1)}(\\xi)$", "（\\cref{prop:b3:clt:cfbasics}(d)）对每个 $\\xi$ 成立。由列维", "连续性定理（\\cref{thm:b3:clt:levy}）推出 $T_n \\Rightarrow \\mathcal", "N(0,1)$。区间概率随之成立，因为 $F_{\\mathcal", "N}$ 处处连续。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[置信区间，诚实推导]", "\\label{ex:b3:clt:confidence}", "对 $n$ 位独立选民作民意调查；$\\hat p_n = S_n/n$ 用于估计", "真实比例 $p$，其中 $\\sigma^2 = p(1-p) \\leq \\frac14$。由中心极限定理", "可得，对充分大的 $n$，", "\\[", "\\P\\Bigl(\\abs{\\hat p_n - p} \\leq", "\\frac{z}{2\\sqrt n}\\Bigr)", "\\;\\geq\\; \\P\\Bigl(\\Bigl|\\frac{S_n - np}{\\sigma\\sqrt n}\\Bigr|", "\\leq z\\Bigr)", "\\longrightarrow \\Phi(z) - \\Phi(-z),", "\\]", "其中 $\\Phi$ 为标准高斯分布的分布函数。", "取 $z = 1.96$，此时渐近置信水平为 $95\\%$，而", "误差限 $\\frac{1.96}{2\\sqrt n} \\leq 3\\%$ 要求 $n \\geq", "\\bigl(\\frac{1.96}{0.06}\\bigr)^2 \\approx 1068$ --- 这正是", "人们在每条“$\\pm3$ 个百分点，$95\\%$”报道背后读到的数字；与", "切比雪夫给出的 $5556$（\\cref{exo:b3:probability:7}）相比。", "$\\sqrt n$ 因子具有普遍性：要使误差减半，", "须将样本量增至四倍 --- 这与决定蒙特卡罗方法代价的规律相同", "（\\cref{exo:b3:clt:7}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{高斯向量}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:clt:gaussianvector}", "称随机向量 $X = (X_1, \\dots, X_d)$ 为", "\\emph{高斯向量}\\index{高斯向量}，若其每个线性组合", "$\\langle t, X\\rangle = \\sum t_iX_i$ 均为", "（可能退化的）实高斯变量。其分布", "由均值向量 $m = (\\E X_i)$ 及", "\\emph{协方差矩阵} $\\Sigma = \\bigl(\\operatorname{Cov}", "(X_i, X_j)\\bigr)$：事实上，", "向量的特征函数 $\\varphi_X(t) = \\E\\eu^{\\iu\\langle t, X\\rangle}$ 恰为", "在 $1$ 处取值的 $\\langle t, X\\rangle$ 的特征函数：", "\\[", "\\varphi_X(t) = \\exp\\Bigl(\\iu\\langle t, m\\rangle -", "\\tfrac12\\,t^{\\mathsf T}\\Sigma\\,t\\Bigr),", "\\]", "且 $d$ 维特征函数是单射", "（证明与\\cref{thm:b3:clt:injectivity}中的光滑化方法相同，", "逐坐标取高斯变量）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:b3:clt:gaussianvector}", "设 $X$ 为高斯向量。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 任一仿射像 $AX + b$ 均为高斯向量。", "  \\item 分量 $X_i$ 相互\\emph{独立}当且仅当", "        $\\Sigma$ 为对角矩阵：对联合高斯变量，", "        不相关 $=$ 独立。", "  \\item 若 $\\Sigma$ 可逆，则 $X$ 具有密度", "        $\\frac{1}{(2\\pi)^{d/2}\\sqrt{\\det\\Sigma}}", "        \\exp\\bigl(-\\frac12(x - m)^{\\mathsf T}\\Sigma^{-1}(x -", "        m)\\bigr)$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}